display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada e Trilhos 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 6 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 4.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o evento Trilhos de S\u00e3o F\u00e9lix 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 6 de setembro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 08:30 junto \u00e0 Igreja Paroquial de S\u00e3o F\u00e9lix, em S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e a dificuldade do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso tem cerca de 10 km por trilhos rurais e florestais, com n\u00edvel de dificuldade acess\u00edvel a praticantes regulares de caminhada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor de 4,00 \u20ac e inclui seguro de acidentes pessoais, acompanhamento t\u00e9cnico ao longo do tra\u00e7ado e refor\u00e7o alimentar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que equipamento \u00e9 recomendado levar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Recomenda-se cal\u00e7ado de caminhada\/trail com boa ader\u00eancia, roupa confort\u00e1vel e garrafa de \u00e1gua individual para hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es podem ser feitas online na plataforma Stop and Go ou presencialmente no Complexo Desportivo e Postos de Turismo de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos de S\u00e3o F\u00e9lix 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Igreja Paroquial de S\u00e3o F\u00e9lix\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o evento Trilhos de S\u00e3o F\u00e9lix 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 6 de setembro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 08:30 junto \u00e0 Igreja Paroquial de S\u00e3o F\u00e9lix, em S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e a dificuldade do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso tem cerca de 10 km por trilhos rurais e florestais, com n\u00edvel de dificuldade acess\u00edvel a praticantes regulares de caminhada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor de 4,00 \u20ac e inclui seguro de acidentes pessoais, acompanhamento t\u00e9cnico ao longo do tra\u00e7ado e refor\u00e7o alimentar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que equipamento \u00e9 recomendado levar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Recomenda-se cal\u00e7ado de caminhada\/trail com boa ader\u00eancia, roupa confort\u00e1vel e garrafa de \u00e1gua individual para hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es podem ser feitas online na plataforma Stop and Go ou presencialmente no Complexo Desportivo e Postos de Turismo de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":63563,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22],"event_type_2":[726,820,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63562","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sao-pedro-do